      "why": "The unit tests pin the charge ramp; this is the only thing that renders it, and a new room bounces by default, so without it CI never draws the ramp most rooms actually use (#176).",
      "command": "pnpm exec tsx scripts/bomb-preview-smoke.ts",
      "browsers": ["chrome"],
